                    {
                        "sense_id": "ddefaed7-ed85-312c-a419-7bbc84364786",
                        "entry_id": "7f4b1999-0540-3762-a40e-8bac63d16565",
                        "glosses": [
                            "rags, tatters"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f907648c-1c47-4fd7-929f-fb0fce569e45",
                                "sense_id": "ddefaed7-ed85-312c-a419-7bbc84364786",
                                "text": "Там, у пе́чки, в кото́рой стря́палось ку́шанье, хлопота́ла ма́ленькая сго́рбленная старушо́нка, така́я гря́зная и в тако́м отврати́тельном отре́бье, что жа́лко бы́ло смотре́ть на неё.",
                                "translation": "There by the stove in which the cooking was done a little humpbacked old woman was busily at work, so filthy and clothed in such rags that she was a pitiful sight.",
                                "english": "There by the stove in which the cooking was done a little humpbacked old woman was busily at work, so filthy and clothed in such rags that she was a pitiful sight."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
